  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21526198",
      "title": "Introducing Slots",
      "lectureOrder": 114,
      "videoOrder": 97,
      "sourceHash": "b1d3fc9220a7532a0830443a20378c1d6e4978dc6819d5a9d00605b8eed3117f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 3.77,
          "en": "There is another cool feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.77,
          "end": 5.79,
          "en": "when it comes to Vue Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.79,
          "end": 7.34,
          "en": "which once you know it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.34,
          "end": 9.42,
          "en": "will give you way more options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.42,
          "end": 11.09,
          "en": "of structuring your code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.09,
          "end": 13.83,
          "en": "and splitting your code into multiple components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.83,
          "end": 16.74,
          "en": "and that would be the feature of slots.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.74,
          "end": 18.283,
          "en": "Now what are slots about?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.32,
          "end": 21.01,
          "en": "Let me show you an example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.01,
          "end": 22.53,
          "en": "In Userinfo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 22.53,
          "end": 26.593,
          "en": "we have this section with a header and a paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.44,
          "end": 32.143,
          "en": "In BadgeList we also have a section with some content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.44,
          "end": 34.82,
          "en": "Now the content is different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.82,
          "end": 36.49,
          "en": "but there is one important thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 36.49,
          "end": 38.36,
          "en": "which both components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 38.36,
          "end": 41.25,
          "en": "BadgeList and UserInfo have in common",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.25,
          "end": 42.91,
          "en": "and that's the section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 42.91,
          "end": 44.92,
          "en": "but actually not just a section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 44.92,
          "end": 48.74,
          "en": "but the section and the styling that's being applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 48.74,
          "end": 49.863,
          "en": "to that section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 50.87,
          "end": 53.3,
          "en": "You might remember in the last lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 53.3,
          "end": 55.14,
          "en": "I copied the styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 55.14,
          "end": 57.71,
          "en": "to ensure that the section has the same style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 57.71,
          "end": 59.293,
          "en": "in both components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 60.7,
          "end": 61.65,
          "en": "Now of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 61.65,
          "end": 63.43,
          "en": "an alternative would have been",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 63.43,
          "end": 65.82,
          "en": "to simply make section a global style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 65.82,
          "end": 67.28,
          "en": "here in App.vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 67.28,
          "end": 68.97,
          "en": "where the style is not scoped",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 70.28,
          "end": 72.23,
          "en": "but another alternative would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 72.23,
          "end": 74.5,
          "en": "to create a standalone component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 74.5,
          "end": 76.7,
          "en": "which simply contains the section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 76.7,
          "end": 78.55,
          "en": "with the attached styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 78.55,
          "end": 80.38,
          "en": "and which then is flexible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 80.38,
          "end": 82.543,
          "en": "regarding the content it receives.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 83.83,
          "end": 86.883,
          "en": "That could be something like a BaseCard component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 87.78,
          "end": 89.07,
          "en": "Now the name is up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 89.07,
          "end": 90.48,
          "en": "but I'm naming it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 90.48,
          "end": 92.87,
          "en": "because I want to create a certain look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 92.87,
          "end": 97.59,
          "en": "which is sometimes referred to as a Card Look in the web.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 97.59,
          "end": 99.95,
          "en": "Basically this look of having a drop shadow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 99.95,
          "end": 101.25,
          "en": "and rounded corners,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 101.25,
          "end": 103.99000000000001,
          "en": "this is often referred to as a Card Look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 105.33,
          "end": 107.36,
          "en": "and I'm going to create a component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 107.36,
          "end": 109.72,
          "en": "which encapsulates that look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 109.72,
          "end": 113.52000000000001,
          "en": "so that we can easily reuse it wherever we want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 113.52000000000001,
          "end": 116.33,
          "en": "and for that here in this template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 116.33,
          "end": 121,
          "en": "I will add a section like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 121,
          "end": 122.86,
          "en": "or maybe also just use a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 122.86,
          "end": 125.91,
          "en": "to make it a bit more reusable semantically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 125.91,
          "end": 127.81,
          "en": "but that's just a minor thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 127.81,
          "end": 129.8,
          "en": "It doesn't really matter here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 129.8,
          "end": 132.02,
          "en": "and then I add my styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 132.02,
          "end": 133.63,
          "en": "and important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 133.63,
          "end": 135.58,
          "en": "I'm going to scope this styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 135.58,
          "end": 137.713,
          "en": "by adding the scoped attribute.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 138.85,
          "end": 143.35,
          "en": "Now I'm going to copy over this section styling here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 145.32999999999998,
          "end": 146.74,
          "en": "to my BaseCard",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 148,
          "end": 150.61,
          "en": "and change it from section to div of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 150.61,
          "end": 152.66,
          "en": "because I'm now having a div here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 154.93,
          "end": 157.06,
          "en": "and now I want to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 157.06,
          "end": 159.18,
          "en": "that the content in here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 159.18,
          "end": 161.25,
          "en": "can be anything we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 161.25,
          "end": 162.5,
          "en": "I basically just want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 162.5,
          "end": 164.61,
          "en": "to use this component as a wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 164.61,
          "end": 166.72,
          "en": "with a certain style attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 166.72,
          "end": 168.65,
          "en": "Now how could we receive content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 168.65,
          "end": 170.663,
          "en": "from outside now though?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 171.57,
          "end": 173.49,
          "en": "Well we learned about props,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 173.49,
          "end": 175.513,
          "en": "we can add a script here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 179.96,
          "end": 181.12,
          "en": "like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 181.12,
          "end": 186.12,
          "en": "and then simply export our default JavaScript object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 187.87,
          "end": 190.01,
          "en": "and now accept some props here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 190.01,
          "end": 192.11,
          "en": "But what would be our props?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 192.11,
          "end": 193.6,
          "en": "Would it be content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 193.6,
          "end": 197.07999999999998,
          "en": "and we then try to output content like this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 197.07999999999998,
          "end": 198.67000000000002,
          "en": "That actually will not work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 198.67000000000002,
          "end": 202.13,
          "en": "because if we now wanna use our Card here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 202.13,
          "end": 204.5,
          "en": "we can't pass in our HTML content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 204.5,
          "end": 206.95,
          "en": "with all those Vue features we're using.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 206.95,
          "end": 208.9,
          "en": "Let me show you what the problem is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 208.9,
          "end": 211.51,
          "en": "Let's say we register this globally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 211.51,
          "end": 213.79,
          "en": "because we're going to use this Card",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 213.79,
          "end": 215.45,
          "en": "in multiple places.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 215.45,
          "end": 216.75,
          "en": "So here in main.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 216.75,
          "end": 218.64,
          "en": "we're going to register it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 219.71,
          "end": 220.95,
          "en": "and then here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 220.95,
          "end": 222.07,
          "en": "with the app.component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 222.07,
          "end": 225.24,
          "en": "we have our BaseCard like that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 226.9,
          "end": 228.54,
          "en": "and now in UserInfo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 228.54,
          "end": 229.76,
          "en": "I wanna use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 229.76,
          "end": 231.4,
          "en": "So I wanna in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 231.4,
          "end": 234.46699999999998,
          "en": "wrap my content here with BaseCard like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 237.64,
          "end": 240.2,
          "en": "I'm not replacing the section with it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 240.2,
          "end": 242.57,
          "en": "but I put my BaseCard into it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 242.57,
          "end": 245.58,
          "en": "and then wrapping this content with BaseCard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 245.58,
          "end": 248.3,
          "en": "This is however not how props work do they?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 248.3,
          "end": 250.7,
          "en": "If I save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 250.7,
          "end": 252.78,
          "en": "I now lost all the content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 252.78,
          "end": 255.62,
          "en": "because Vue doesn't know where to render this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 255.62,
          "end": 258.95,
          "en": "I added it between the text of a custom component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 258.95,
          "end": 262.67,
          "en": "and well, how would you know what to do with that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 262.67,
          "end": 263.983,
          "en": "Where to output it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 265.21,
          "end": 268.53,
          "en": "After all our custom component has its own template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 268.53,
          "end": 270.24,
          "en": "Yes it has a content prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 270.24,
          "end": 273.093,
          "en": "but well Vue doesn't know what's in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 275.33,
          "end": 276.25,
          "en": "Now we could of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 276.25,
          "end": 278.67,
          "en": "set content here equal to a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 278.67,
          "end": 282.12,
          "en": "and pass this content here as a string to content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 282.12,
          "end": 285.533,
          "en": "but then this would no longer be able to use Vue features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 286.57,
          "end": 288.83,
          "en": "So that's all not the solution,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 288.83,
          "end": 292.01,
          "en": "instead it's this slots feature which I mentioned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 292.01,
          "end": 295.93,
          "en": "Vue has a special syntax for this exact scenario",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 295.93,
          "end": 298.56,
          "en": "where you want to use your own component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 298.56,
          "end": 301.72,
          "en": "as a wrapper around dynamic content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 301.72,
          "end": 304.68,
          "en": "So around different kinds of HTML content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 305.91,
          "end": 306.86,
          "en": "and for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 306.86,
          "end": 308.91,
          "en": "you simply go to your component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 308.91,
          "end": 310.5,
          "en": "that should be the wrapper.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 310.5,
          "end": 312.6,
          "en": "You don't use props in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 312.6,
          "end": 315.74,
          "en": "but instead you use a special element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 315.74,
          "end": 318.84,
          "en": "the slot element like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 320.9,
          "end": 322.84,
          "en": "and if you now save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 322.84,
          "end": 324.41,
          "en": "you will see this works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 324.41,
          "end": 326.01,
          "en": "and we got the look we want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 327.82,
          "end": 329.42,
          "en": "and if I go to UserInfo,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 329.42,
          "end": 330.4,
          "en": "please keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 330.4,
          "end": 333.02,
          "en": "that I deleted the section styling here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 333.02,
          "end": 336.21,
          "en": "So this look is really coming from our Card component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 337.28,
          "end": 339.15999999999997,
          "en": "and that's how slots work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 339.15999999999997,
          "end": 343.25,
          "en": "They allow us to receive HTML content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 343.25,
          "end": 345.99,
          "en": "which also may be using Vue features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 345.99,
          "end": 348.14300000000003,
          "en": "from outside of the component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 349.3,
          "end": 351.54,
          "en": "Basically just like props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 351.54,
          "end": 354.76,
          "en": "but where props are meant to be used for data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
          "start": 354.76,
          "end": 356.12,
          "en": "which a component needs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 137,
          "start": 356.12,
          "end": 359.54,
          "en": "slots are meant to be used for HTML code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 138,
          "start": 359.54,
